The 2 phrases every person in Japan says at every meal 🍙
Say them once and you'll sound like you belong.

Today's phrases:
• いただきます (itadakimasu) = Said before eating
• ごちそうさまでした (gochisousama deshita) = Said after eating
• おいしい (oishii) = Delicious

